1
00:00:00,274 --> 00:00:02,674
(Leonard:)Hey, look at this.

2
00:00:02,676 --> 00:00:06,016
"Dear Roger, to be opened
upon your first great discovery.

3
00:00:06,013 --> 00:00:08,043
Love, Mom."

4
00:00:08,048 --> 00:00:09,878
(Leonard:)Wow, look at the date.

5
00:00:09,883 --> 00:00:13,223
He saved this 50 years
and never got to open it.

6
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:15,550
(Howard:)That's intense.

7
00:00:15,556 --> 00:00:18,486
(Raj:)Poor Roger Abbott.

8
00:00:18,492 --> 00:00:23,332
(laughing): Roger Abbott sounds
just like Roger Rabbit.

9
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:27,230
(Raj:)Roger Abbott, Roger Abbott,
Roger Abbott.

10
00:00:27,234 --> 00:00:30,534
(Raj:)Oh, my God, Leonard, I know
he's dead, but try it. It's fun!

11
00:00:31,572 --> 00:00:33,072
(Raj:)Roger Abbott,
Roger Abbott...

12
00:00:34,208 --> 00:00:36,708
DAN:
Penny!

13
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:39,310
(chuckles)
Oh, my rookie of the year.

14
00:00:39,313 --> 00:00:42,143
(Penny:)Oh, Dan. My boss who didn't want
to hire me

15
00:00:42,149 --> 00:00:44,349
(Penny:)and now's a little hug machine.
(chuckles)
Oh,

16
00:00:44,351 --> 00:00:45,921
(Dan:)look at you. Brand-new

17
00:00:45,919 --> 00:00:48,249
(Dan:)and already
the third best sales rep.

18
00:00:48,255 --> 00:00:50,025
Aw. Yes.
Why don't you come over
to my table.

19
00:00:50,023 --> 00:00:51,923
(Penny:)I'll be right there.
Bernadette's just
parking the car.

20
00:00:51,925 --> 00:00:54,925
(Dan:)Oh, good.

21
00:00:54,928 --> 00:00:57,528
(Dan:)Bernadette. Cute, sweet...

